# 7. PREVIEW AUTO-DIALER

This is the primary feature.

If a user is logged in and changes their mode to:

```text
PREVIEW AUTO
```

the system should automatically start processing leads from campaigns assigned to that user.

Flow:

```text
Agent enters PREVIEW mode
        ↓
Check assigned campaign
        ↓
Find next available lead
        ↓
Reserve/lock lead
        ↓
Display lead information
        ↓
Start outbound call
        ↓
Wait for call result
        ↓
If answered
        ↓
Agent handles call
        ↓
Call ends
        ↓
Save disposition
        ↓
Get next lead
```

IMPORTANT:

The same lead must NEVER be called simultaneously by two agents.

Implement database-level lead locking/reservation.

